OL,3,GNEWSARockfall risk repairs force
OL,4,Aeight-week road closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly eight weeks of road closures are
OL,7,Fset to begin in Ross-on-Wye as work
OL,8,Fgets under way on a long-term solution
OL,9,Fto rockfall issues at the Wilton rock
OL,10,Fface.
OL,12,FHerefordshire Council has appointed a
OL,13,Fcontractor to carry out the programme,
OL,14,Fwith work scheduled from 19 October
OL,15,Funtil 11 December.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
