OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSARockfall risk repairs force
OL,4,Aeight-week road closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe scheme follows a series of
OL,7,Frockfalls in recent years, including an
OL,8,Fincident in 2019 which forced the
OL,9,Fclosure of Wilton Road while temporary
OL,10,Fsafety barriers were installed. Further
OL,11,Frockfalls have since been contained by
OL,12,Fthose barriers.
OL,14,FWilton Road will be fully closed
OL,15,Fbetween both junctions with Wye Street
OL,16,Fthroughout the project. Royal Parade
OL,17,Fwill also remain closed for the
OL,18,Fduration of the works.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
